<title>EGYPT: Egyptian firm seeks 50,000 tonnes wheat.</title>
<headline>Egyptian firm seeks 50,000 tonnes wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's Holding Company for Rice and Flour Mills said on Friday it wanted to buy 50,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red wheat or Australian hard wheat for shipment between September 20 and 30, or between November 20 and 30, buyer's option.</p>
<p>The deadline for bids, on fax number +20 2 454 8152, is 8 a.m. local (0500 GMT) on Monday September 9 and the result will be announced at about 4 p.m. (1300 GMT) the same day.</p>
<p>Prices should be quoted FOB and C + F free out MED.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Wright +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
